 {"sec": "Airway, breathing and intubation · p254", "page": 254, "q": "Routine cricoid pressure is:", "opts": ["Preferred over jaw thrust", "Mandatory", "Avoided to prevent cartilage damage", "Used in every intubation"], "ans": 2, "exp": "Routine use to be avoided (to prevent cartilage damage). (Book p254)", "type": "mcq", "id": "PEDS-C53-078"},
