 {"sec": "Vascular access, AED and rhythms · p255", "page": 255, "q": "The goal of vascular access in resuscitation is:", "opts": ["Pressure monitoring", "Blood transfusion", "Fluid sampling only", "Administration of medications"], "ans": 3, "exp": "Goal: administration of medications. (Book p255)", "type": "mcq", "id": "PEDS-C53-087"},
