 {"sec": "Vascular access, AED and rhythms · p255", "page": 255, "q": "The AED shock causes ___ depolarisation of the myocardium.", "opts": ["graded", "synchronous", "asynchronous", "partial"], "ans": 2, "exp": "Causes asynchronous depolarisation of myocardium (shock). (Book p255)", "type": "fill", "id": "PEDS-C53-094"},
